@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}
@jwtToken = {{$dotenv JWT_TOKEN}}
@adminToken = {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### ── Hành trình anyLEARN (plan 21) ──────────────────────────────────────

### Journey of the signed-in account (without a token: visitor view, every chapter locked)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/journey
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Pay every mission that is done and every complete chapter (safe to call often)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/journey/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### A signal only the app sees: pwa_install | near | compare (once per account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/journey/event
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "compare"}

### ── anyLEARN Foundation ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Public state (house in progress, finished houses, latest contributions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/foundation?recent=20

### What registering a course gives the fund (course page line)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/foundation/item/1

### "Gạch của tôi"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/foundation/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Hide my name in the public list
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/foundation/hide-name
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hide": true}

### ── Learner tier ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### The account and its children with their tier and finished courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/learner-tier
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### The parent marks a course as finished
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/learner-tier/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enrollmentId": 1}

### ── Guest quiz (no login) ─────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/guest-quiz

### Grade one answer (option 0-3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/guest-quiz/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{"questionId": 1, "option": 0}

### Registering with game guest_quiz pays the sign-up Leo Xu once
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Me Bin Thu", "phone": "0912345678", "password": "123456", "game": "guest_quiz"}

### ── Admin ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/gamification/journey
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Settings (numbers by key; see the fields of the GET)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/gamification/journey/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numbers": {"add_child_coins": 50, "chapter2_points": 0}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/gamification/milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/gamification/milestones/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numbers": {"first_order_coins": 300, "referral_coins": 300}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/gamification/guest-quiz
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/gamification/guest-quiz/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numbers": {"questions": 5, "signup_coins": 100}, "topic": "parenting"}

### Foundation: state, settings, seed, house details
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/foundation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/foundation/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"numbers": {"house_value": 80000000}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/foundation/seed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 5000000, "note": "anyLEARN góp khởi động"}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/foundation/houses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"school": "Trường TH Lũng Cú", "place": "Hà Giang", "openedOn": "2027-03-15"}

### Learner tier: list, revoke / restore, add, sync one learner, settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/learner-tier?status=all&page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/learner-tier/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "revoked", "note": "Bé nghỉ giữa chừng"}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/learner-tier
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"learnerId": 2, "itemId": 1, "note": "Xác nhận với trường"}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/learner-tier/sync/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
